# Implementer — MVP build rules

Source of truth: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (§1–10).  
RX / DeepCW port: `docs/ARCHITECTURE_RX_DEEPCW.md` (normative; DEC-005).  
Active tasks: `docs/HANDOFF.md` → **For Implementer**.

## Hard constraints

- **Do not** edit `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Blockers → HANDOFF **For Architect**.
- Stack only: **C++17**, **Qt 5 Widgets**, **QtSerialPort**, **CMake ≥ 3.16**, AppImage x86_64.
- No Qt 6. No sidetone, paddle, receive, macros, or non-Linux targets in MVP.
- Prefer small, compile-verified changes. Update HANDOFF status when done.
- Documentation, comments, **and all UI strings: English only**.

## Modules (keep this layout)

```text
src/main.cpp
src/MainWindow.*          # GUI only; paints TX progress; no Morse timing; no QSerialPort I/O
src/MorseEncoder.*        # static ITU encode + unitMs(wpm); no I/O
src/KeyerEngine.*         # QThread; timing; emit progressChanged(charsCompleted)
src/SerialKeyLine.*       # QSerialPort RTS/DTR + polarity; key-up on close/abort
```

## Timing & encoding

- PARIS: `unitMs = 1200.0 / wpm`; dit=1, dah=3, elem gap=1, char gap=3, word gap=7.
- Uppercase before encode; map A–Z, 0–9, `= / ? . ,`; space → WordGap; unknown → omit.
- Timing on keyer thread with `steady_clock` absolute deadlines — **not** `QTimer` on GUI.

## Hardware keying

- Open `QSerialPort` 9600 8N1; key via RTS **or** DTR only; unused line idle (key-up).
- Polarity: normal asserted=key-down; inverted negates. Always force key-up on stop/finish/error.
- Cooperative `requestStop()` between elements.

## UI (MainWindow) — English + progress + Esc stop

- Controls: Port+Refresh, RTS|DTR, WPM 5–50, Invert polarity, text, Transmit/`Stop (Esc)`, status.
- Strings: English per ARCHITECTURE §7.2 (no Spanish labels/status/errors).
- While TX: disable port/line/polarity/WPM/Transmit; text read-only; enable Stop; **Esc** → same stop handler (§7.4); idle Esc must not quit/clear.
- Progress (ARCHITECTURE §7.3): engine emits `progressChanged(int charsCompleted)` on source `Job::text`; UI styles `[0, charsCompleted)` as **sent** (`QPalette::Link` recommended) vs pending default; do not mutate text to show progress; keep partial highlight on Stop; clear on edit / new TX.

## RX / DeepCW (when DEC-005 is Open)

- Follow `ARCHITECTURE_RX_DEEPCW.md` exactly (9600 Hz, FFT 768, hop 144, 65 bins, `noise_q90_log1p`, CTC blank 41).
- Phase order mandatory: RX-1 offline → RX-2 live UI (**incl. required waterfall §7.3 / DEC-006**) → RX-3 streaming → RX-4 pileup.
- Waterfall is **required** for RX debugging (live scroll, Hz axis, center/BW overlay, click/wheel tune); not optional.
- Do not invent alternate decoders; do not port React/WASM/Web Serial keyer/JA/NR-marketing.
- Ship `resources/models/deepcw_en.onnx` + ORT in AppImage; attribute MIT in `docs/THIRD_PARTY.md`.

## Clean rebuild (ALWAYS — see also `implementer-clean-rebuild.mdc`)

Before Done / before anyone runs the app: delete `build`, `build-appimage`, `AppDir`, `dist`, and old `*.AppImage`; then full Release reconfigure+build. Rebuild AppImage if that is what will be launched. Quote the exact fresh path. Policy: ARCHITECTURE §8.1.

## Done when

Clean rebuild done (§8.1); acceptance §10 met; HANDOFF item marked Done with fresh binary path(s).
